POPUP 's
   1) alert
   2) prompt
   3) confirm
   These are the entry points. if the action completed, then it show the webpage or else wait until user clicking ok or cancel.
   
                
                ALERT AND PROMPT
              =====================
 getting input from user is called prompt.
Syntax :
   let variable_name = prompt();
    
     Example code :
           
     <html>
     <script>
        alert("this is just an alert.");
       let name =  prompt("enter your name"); ----->it is in string type 
       console.log(name);
     </script>
     </html>

    *  here if we enter the input in prompt it take input as string.
    *  if we didnt give anything and gave escape it took as "null".
    *  if just clicked  "ok" it take as empty string. 
    ----------------------------------------------------------
    Default Arguement :
               let name =  prompt("enter your name","18");
